OL,3,GNEWSALarge fire breaks out at Mitcham
OL,4,Aindustrial site
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a large fire
OL,7,Fat an industrial site in south London,
OL,8,Fwith thick black smoke billowing across
OL,9,Fthe area.
OL,11,FThe premises contain a workshop, tyre
OL,12,Fcentre and scaffolding yard, and the
OL,13,Ffire has spread to about four hectares
OL,14,F(nearly 10 acres) of surrounding
OL,15,Fscrubland.
OL,17,FThe London Fire Brigade (LFB) sent 125
OL,18,Fcrew members and 25 engine to the scene
OL,19,Fnear Carshalton Road in Mitcham.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
