OL,3,GNEWSALarge fire breaks out at Mitcham
OL,4,Aindustrial site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cause of the fire is not yet known
OL,7,Fand the LFB has urged residents to keep
OL,8,Ftheir windows closed.
